    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>The space sport &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER&quot; is all the rage in the galaxy.<br>And UFO pilots, known as Shwoopers, are battling it out today!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Shuforians compete in intense 1v1 battles for supremacy!\u25c6</h2>Deposit the &quot;<i>target</i>&quot; item into your goal to score.<br>The key to victory is to control the stage items!<br>Use your shwoop beam to collect the target before your rival and bring it home!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.poster.avif?t=1689292639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.webm?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.mp4?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Or use the beam to intercept, throw, and attack your opponent!<br>Anything goes when trying to get the prize!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.poster.avif?t=1689292639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.webm?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.mp4?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use the stage gimmicks and special items to your advantage to win!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/97cbb5a34dc8b7b93ca10e8bc2dbd050.poster.avif?t=1689292639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/97cbb5a34dc8b7b93ca10e8bc2dbd050.webm?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/97cbb5a34dc8b7b93ca10e8bc2dbd050.mp4?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Play alone, or together with friends online!\u25c6</h2>Or friends to play <i>local battles!</i><br>Multiple modes and settings for <i>online play!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6And much more!\u25c6</h2>Need to practice? <br>Jump in the <i>training mode</i> to study new UFOs.<br>Or check your progress as a Shwooper in the <i>Collection Mode!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/fe59b10a2a0cccbb9f8ff715cab96371.avif?t=1689292639\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6About SUPER UFO FIGHTER Friend's Pass\u25c6</h2>This is a free application allows you to play online with people who own the full version of &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER<br>Cross-play with different platforms is possible.<br><br>\u25a0\u25a0Matching procedure\u25a0\u25a0<br><br>A: Players playing with the full version of &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER&quot;<br><br>1)After launching the application, select &quot;Online&quot; from the main menu.<br>2)Select the connection region where you want to play the game.<br>3) Select &quot;Friend Match&quot; -&gt; &quot;Create Room&quot; and tell the person you want to play with the 6-digit code that appears on the screen.<br><br>B: Players playing with &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER Friend's Pass&quot;<br><br>1) After launching the application, select &quot;Online&quot; from the main menu.<br>2) Select the same connection region as the player you want to play with.<br>3) Select &quot;Friend Match&quot; -&gt; &quot;Join a room&quot; and enter the 6-digit code given to you by the player you are playing with.<br><br>When playing, make sure that the version displayed in the upper left corner of the &quot;Online&quot; mode menu (&quot;Version : \u25cb\u25cb&quot;) is the same as that of the player you are playing with.<br>If the version is not the same, you will not be able to play online.<br>-----------------------------<br>If you have the full version of the game or are thinking about playing with friends, please take advantage of the &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER Friend's Pass&quot; as well!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The space sport &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER&quot; is all the rage in the galaxy.<br>And UFO pilots, known as Shwoopers, are battling it out today!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Shuforians compete in intense 1v1 battles for supremacy!\u25c6</h2>Deposit the &quot;<i>target</i>&quot; item into your goal to score.<br>The key to victory is to control the stage items!<br>Use your shwoop beam to collect the target before your rival and bring it home!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.poster.avif?t=1689292639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.webm?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.mp4?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Or use the beam to intercept, throw, and attack your opponent!<br>Anything goes when trying to get the prize!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.poster.avif?t=1689292639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.webm?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.mp4?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use the stage gimmicks and special items to your advantage to win!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/97cbb5a34dc8b7b93ca10e8bc2dbd050.poster.avif?t=1689292639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/97cbb5a34dc8b7b93ca10e8bc2dbd050.webm?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/97cbb5a34dc8b7b93ca10e8bc2dbd050.mp4?t=1689292639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Play alone, or together with friends online!\u25c6</h2>Or friends to play <i>local battles!</i><br>Multiple modes and settings for <i>online play!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6And much more!\u25c6</h2>Need to practice? <br>Jump in the <i>training mode</i> to study new UFOs.<br>Or check your progress as a Shwooper in the <i>Collection Mode!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/fe59b10a2a0cccbb9f8ff715cab96371.avif?t=1689292639\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6About SUPER UFO FIGHTER Friend's Pass\u25c6</h2>This is a free application allows you to play online with people who own the full version of &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER<br>Cross-play with different platforms is possible.<br><br>\u25a0\u25a0Matching procedure\u25a0\u25a0<br><br>A: Players playing with the full version of &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER&quot;<br><br>1)After launching the application, select &quot;Online&quot; from the main menu.<br>2)Select the connection region where you want to play the game.<br>3) Select &quot;Friend Match&quot; -&gt; &quot;Create Room&quot; and tell the person you want to play with the 6-digit code that appears on the screen.<br><br>B: Players playing with &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER Friend's Pass&quot;<br><br>1) After launching the application, select &quot;Online&quot; from the main menu.<br>2) Select the same connection region as the player you want to play with.<br>3) Select &quot;Friend Match&quot; -&gt; &quot;Join a room&quot; and enter the 6-digit code given to you by the player you are playing with.<br><br>When playing, make sure that the version displayed in the upper left corner of the &quot;Online&quot; mode menu (&quot;Version : \u25cb\u25cb&quot;) is the same as that of the player you are playing with.<br>If the version is not the same, you will not be able to play online.<br>-----------------------------<br>If you have the full version of the game or are thinking about playing with friends, please take advantage of the &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER Friend's Pass&quot; as well!",
